      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However,\nas the sample was found to be of substandard quality as per the report sent by both the laboratories,\ntherefore, the charge under Section 3(ZX) read with Section 51 NEUTRAL CITATION NO.\n2024:MPHC-IND:26169 3 MCRC-10196-2017 of the "
