      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From the record of the Trial Court it is clear that after the matter was remanded, the Trial Court by order dated 4.11.2016 directed the competent authority to obtain the report from the Referral Laboratory as required under Section 47(1)(i"
    },
    {
